00:02:34.260 --> 00:02:40.580
about how national budgets actually come together. In parliamentary systems such as Australia's,

00:02:40.580 --> 00:02:46.560
the Treasurer works with the Treasury Department and other ministries to reconcile revenue forecasts,

00:02:47.180 --> 00:02:51.440
spending requests, and policy priorities months before the speech.

00:02:52.240 --> 00:02:57.860
The final document must also align with the government's legislative timetable and coalition

00:02:57.860 --> 00:03:03.320
